   $q$Listen. Honey bees are very important insects. Bees carry pollen from flower to flower, and that helps many plants make fruit and seeds. Without bees, we might have fewer apples and berries. Bees make honey that people and animals eat. Honey bees also make wax, which people use to make candles and crayons. Which is NOT a reason the author gives? Tap the words.$q$, $q$[{"text":"They can sting.","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"They can sting."}},{"text":"They make honey.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"They make honey."}},{"text":"They help plants.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"They help plants."}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$They can sting.$q$, $q$Many bees can sting, but the author does not give that as a reason. The reasons are that bees help plants make fruit, and they make honey and wax.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
